qualification-identifiers:
Qualification project — identifier handling settings (applies to identifier formatting/capture work in the "qualification" project). Identifiers are opaque strings; surrounding whitespace is trimmed, while leading zeros and case are preserved. Examples: "000417", "AC-019". Source: settings supplied in issue trial-89a (Qualify capture CLI integration).

```json
{
  "project": "qualification",
  "identifiers": {
    "kind": "opaque-string",
    "trim": true
  },
  "examples": ["000417", "AC-019"]
}
```
